---
// Shown on every page when site.regulated is true (therapy, medical and other clinical practices).
---
<aside class="crisis" aria-label="Emergency help">
  <p class="wrap">
    If you are in crisis or thinking about harming yourself, call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a>
    (Suicide and Crisis Lifeline) or call <a href="tel:911">911</a>. This website and its forms are not
    monitored for emergencies.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .crisis { background: var(--color-alert-bg); color: var(--color-alert-text); }
  .crisis p { margin: 0; padding-block: var(--space-2); max-width: none; }
  .crisis a { color: var(--color-alert-text); font-weight: 700; }
</style>
